  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "db7defa4-6302-924b-af8f-65230bff2f8d"],
 " lowest-energy eigenstates are retained after sorting at each sample."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->685223655,ExpressionUUID->"e53f14da-5c74-2a44-a85d-464fd474c670"],

Cell["\<\
The path is closed internally by connecting the final occupied subspace back \
to the first; a repeated endpoint is optional.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->562497456,ExpressionUUID->"382c5540-0b98-1c4c-85df-d2a7b9b21dbe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The package multiplies eigenphases by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{"-", 
     FractionBox["1", "\[Pi]"]}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "161d57d1-bc90-fa4e-87cd-9295aba387fb"],
 ", as shown below. This differs by a factor of two from conventions \
expressed in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]"}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "1d2d44bb-0667-0e4d-b54e-8f83a0c117a2"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1620805162,ExpressionUUID->"f0aed67d-9b71-6c43-9eb9-4fe684fbeeb2"],

Cell["\<\
A separated occupied subspace and a sufficiently dense path are needed for a \
stable result.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1674627728,ExpressionUUID->"e46a48f7-d394-904f-8858-00bca54de4be"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Eigensystem"]], "paclet:ref/Eigensystem"},
